# --- Local-only working documents ------------------------------------------
# Internal planning/audit docs and agent scratch files: kept on this machine,
# never published to the repository.
#
# Note the `*` on the AGENTS patterns: a bare `AGENTS.md` does NOT match
# `AGENTS.md.local`, and `git add -A` will happily commit the copy.
TODO*.md
SPEC.md
REPORT*.md
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.md.*
opencode.txt

